":2,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 11; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Marrow Agrisupply problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":11,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Marrow Agrisupply for escalations on the Nettle rollout is Caspian Halvorsen from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in your DM. I told them Maren Tolland is now noted as their go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel for the Linden rollout, and that it stays between us.\n\nI didn't save anything separately. The workspace brain already records direct messages automatically, and it only shows this one to Hollis.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
